        <mxCell id="9PRBQKjkKrYQVyG5I4b1-20" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Overall Flow (End-to-End)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Task - IT Infra Team&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;Client Apps (left side)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; Both Prod App and QA App will be sending requests to same domain / subdomain&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;Network Layer (firewall / gateway)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; Requests first hit a gateway/firewall/reverse proxy layer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;This layer controls access and routes traffic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;After filtering/routing, requests are &lt;b&gt;forwarded to: app-middleware-server-ip:8686&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Task - Application Team&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. Install JVM (LTS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2. Install 2 instances of Tomcat server (LTS)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3. Install Nginx and route:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt; /gw → route to Prod Tomcat instance (running on port 8686)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;/qa-gw → route to QA Tomcat instance (running on port 8787)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4. Install middleware application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; To perform the installation, application team need access to VM with administrator rights&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="520" width="730" x="70" y="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
